    "text": "image-001.jpg:L001: ab oui formaquia\nimage-001.jpg:L002: cepcõms inclłetĩe\nimage-001.jpg:L003: rudicis in actu re\nimage-001.jpg:L004: Uam aprecedent\nimage-001.jpg:L005: de midari gͦ stacĩ cũ hẽt̾ ista demitacõhẽ\nimage-001.jpg:L006: tͦ illa dipõ ĩ mͣ que requitit᷑ ad ħ qd pͦ\nimage-001.jpg:L007: sit tecipe aĩain intlłcti̾ani cũ gͦ incorrup\nimage-001.jpg:L008: oe mi le uyis siuetns ia emi\nimage-001.jpg:L009: m ͤ ẜ ti in ip̃a cormpcone senus e\nimage-001.jpg:L010: illa dispõne que reqnrit᷑ adħ ꝙ possit\nimage-001.jpg:L011: nr aꝑe ꝙ̃ anio itħbẽ an  ᷤ rusi ͭ ͣ g ͦ⁊s cͤas lane\nimage-001.jpg:L012: form de poͣ mͤ ẽducet qmͣ sit in adnẽtu nñ\nimage-001.jpg:L013: clłctĩe oꝑt̾et coꝵpi sit g ͦ p qd̾ illa forma\nimage-001.jpg:L014: que mmͣ cor ᷝ ᷤᷤ hñami educta funt de poͣ ipm̃s\nimage-001.jpg:L015: ꝑũcutem gn̾antis in aduentu intlłctĩe nõ\nimage-001.jpg:L016: coꝵpitͣ qr frust ͣ fuss educta. It̾mħ id̾nf. . sce\nimage-001.jpg:L017: ro ꝑmamaliam c̾tũ ẽ ir qd ꝑftẽ lepro sus\nimage-001.jpg:L018: su̾at leprosũ semꝑ uł freꝙ̃t̾ ħ a̾ nõ eẽt\nimage-001.jpg:L019: U̾m si maduentu inclłctĩe fr̃et resoło usq\nimage-001.jpg:L020: ad eem mn ͤ p̾me sicut ꝓbabo Sͦ cũ inałctiã.\nimage-001.jpg:L021: man forma educta depoͣ m ͤ qd aũt ꝑstẽ\nimage-001.jpg:L022: leprosus nõ gn̾aret leꝓsũ Rr uł freꝙ̃t᷑. si\nimage-001.jpg:L023: aduentu inclłctĩe fi̾et resolucõ nsq ad e\nimage-001.jpg:L024: emͣ m ͤ pͥme proͦ sic ħ .n. acaũ nõ pou eẽ qr\nimage-001.jpg:L025: ea q̃ sũt acañ accidũt raro ⁊ ut inpancõri\nimage-001.jpg:L026: bus n ͨ eẽc illꝰ infeccõnes in proledare aliꝙͣ\nimage-001.jpg:L027: cãm dec̾iãtam/ planũ est .n. qd̾ eẽ m ͤ p̾me\nimage-001.jpg:L028: nõ poss eẽ cansa illius infeccõnis quia de\nimage-001.jpg:L029: se indift̾ens est ad ħ ut sic młano ⁊ lepro\nimage-001.jpg:L030: so n ͨ ⁊ amĩa intlłctĩa quia pot̃ eẽ ⁊ ꝑfcõsa\nimage-001.jpg:L031: ni et leprosi n ͨ acci ꝯseꝙcia exñcia aĩeiͣ\nimage-001.jpg:L032: clltĩe in mͣ ꝯñcia nat᷑ali. Quia tũt oñs\nimage-001.jpg:L033: homo eẽt leprosus / n ͨ poc̃ dici qd̾ illa cã\nimage-001.jpg:L034: dec̾iata sit influenͣ corꝑis aliti tm̃ Qma\nimage-001.jpg:L035: moad̾m horia genetarẽcͤ\nimage-001.jpg:L036: młci a saniis inano locotin qͣ horagñati\nimage-001.jpg:L037: ssĩc aleproi\nimage-001.jpg:L038: Sinõ ita fr̾ent leprosint m\nimage-001.jpg:L039: qd cã dec̾ians nm ad illam iłifeccõm sit\nimage-001.jpg:L040: sꝑũc decist cũ senũe inqnibus fñdat᷑ nis\nimage-001.jpg:L041: informatĩa¶ O ana simaduentu in cłłitĩe\nimage-001.jpg:L042: iret resoło usq ad eem m ͤ pͥmeilłeͥ spñs\nimage-001.jpg:L043: corpent̾. Qua in ilła resołone ꝑiret p᷑\nimage-001.jpg:L044: corꝑeitas ⁊scd̃m anod ułt ꝯstabuls in li ͦ\nimage-001.jpg:L045: de drĩa spñs ⁊n ĩe ꝑ eñte cor ͤ pemit spc ⁊\nimage-001.jpg:L046: pͣ si nõ ꝑirent: adn ͨ nõ possẽt mm ad illã\nimage-001.jpg:L047: infeccõm dec̾iare / Quia forte solilet᷑ colls\nimage-001.jpg:L048: gacõ isłoꝵ spñũ cũ mͣ cor ͥ ᷤᷤ human Qna\nimage-001.jpg:L049: qd̃ isti spñs mag̃ appiciũt nat᷑alt̾ unam\nimage-001.jpg:L050: mat̾am. qmͣ aliam ħ indec̃ eẽ pp̃ aliquas\nimage-001.jpg:L051: dispõnes que sunt in una mͣ et nõ malia\nimage-001.jpg:L052: S si madnentu intlłitĩe fiet resolucõ\nimage-001.jpg:L053: uisq ad eemͣ m ͤ pͥme cũt omĩs dispõ mn ͤꝑ\nimage-001.jpg:L054: cedens iumͣ infnsionẽ aĩe intlłctĩe coꝵpe᷑.\nimage-001.jpg:L055: ⁊sic amonet᷑ iõ quare illi ipñs mag̃ teppi\nimage-001.jpg:L056: cierant istam nm qmͣ aliam łic gͦ ꝑ ac\nimage-001.jpg:L057: quod ꝑillos sp ñs nõ declaret̾ mͣ adillam\nimage-001.jpg:L058: infeccõm restat g ͦ ꝙ ni in aduentu in\nimage-001.jpg:L059: clłttie fi̾et resblucõ usq ad eemͣ mn ͤ pͥme\nimage-001.jpg:L060: ꝙ ꝑ fcẽ leprosus nõ gn̾aret st leprosum\nimage-001.jpg:L061: u ut in płibus ꝙ tñ fłm ẽ testat g ͦ qd̾ cã\nimage-001.jpg:L062: auar̾ ie prosus gn̾at leꝑrosũ sẽꝑue᷑ nt inpłit\n",
